  "description": "The Skyline.DataMiner.Sdk is a development kit designed to streamline the creation and management of DataMiner Installation Packages (.dmapp).\n      By integrating this SDK into your build process, you can easily generate installation packages for DataMiner through a simple project build or compile step. Additionally, it provides tools to publish these packages directly to the DataMiner Catalog, ensuring a smooth and efficient development pipeline.",
